1
00:00:01,447 --> 00:00:03,486
As Uke approaches offer the hand

2
00:00:04,087 --> 00:00:07,876
as Uke cuts down with both hands 
relax the arm,

3
00:00:07,877 --> 00:00:10,696
slide in towards him turning at the same time,

4
00:00:10,697 --> 00:00:13,210
raise your arm up above your head,

5
00:00:13,211 --> 00:00:15,506
turn towards his shoulder and then cut down,

6
00:00:15,707 --> 00:00:18,426
as you do so maintain your extension.

